    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sinking Forest - \u6c88\u3080\u68ee - is a Japanese psychological horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game has autosave system.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My sister Sayuri is missing, and she hasn't answered the phone for days, I have to find her!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has the texts translated with automatic translator. I'm sorry but I don't have the budget to pay for professionals, I hope to be able to do it in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spectacular graphics thanks to Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tragic and macabre horror story </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival Horror where enemys can kill you (and defend your self!) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Japanese forest and village setup with great ambience </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enemys can kill you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game length about 2 hours. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sinking Forest - \u6c88\u3080\u68ee - is a Japanese psychological horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game has autosave system.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My sister Sayuri is missing, and she hasn't answered the phone for days, I have to find her!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has the texts translated with automatic translator. I'm sorry but I don't have the budget to pay for professionals, I hope to be able to do it in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spectacular graphics thanks to Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tragic and macabre horror story </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival Horror where enemys can kill you (and defend your self!) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Japanese forest and village setup with great ambience </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enemys can kill you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game length about 2 hours. </p></li></ul>",
